  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-30.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:30 Recounts; Application. –\n\nAny person for whom a vote was cast and recorded for any office at a town election may, no later than the Friday following the election, apply in writing to the town clerk for a recount of the ballots cast for such office, the clerk shall appoint a time for the recount not earlier than 5 days nor later than 10 days after the receipt of said application."
